  "description": "Point the camera at a page, sign, or label and hear it read aloud. Built for blind users. Touch controls on phones and tablets; keyboard controls on desktops and laptops. Reading is done by an AI service you connect with your own key — Claude, Gemini (free tier), or OpenAI.",
